* ''The asker's session seals'' (operator, 2026-11-06, approving the house's defaults; it sharpens "the asker seals" of 2026-10-19 above). The asker's session seals, on the vessel worker's thread, while that face's session stands unlocked, and `seal-awaits-session` stands. When the asker cannot answer, another admitted, unlocked session of the same face takes the seal, and the takeover refuses once no session of that face stands unlocked. Carriers: <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/k15-wave-b-lane#/the-reds`>>, and `pono/browser-vessel-lift`, carried by the b1 lanes' carriers at their land.

